# .tos_terms — Project-specific prohibited content terms
# =====================================================================
# Copy to .tos_terms and add your project's prohibited terms (gitignored).
#
# The security scanner (phase 13/13) checks committed files for these
# terms to prevent GitHub ToS violations. Terms that should never
# appear in public repositories go here.
#
# Format:
#   term                    — scanned as HIGH severity (default)
#   SEVERITY|term           — scanned at specified severity
#
# Valid severities: CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW
#
# One term per line. Case-insensitive matching.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are skipped.
#
# Examples of what to add:
# CRITICAL|offensive_persona_name
# HIGH|internal_codename
# MEDIUM|private_feature_name
# your_private_api_endpoint
